'''Lucifer the Fallen''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] event. It was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]] has greater health and increases [[Surge Attack]] chance to 100%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]].

