==Trivia==
*Lucifer the Fallen's evolution references [[wikipedia:Lucifer|Lucifer's origin]]: a once kind and beautiful angel, to the point of being named after light, who then falls from heaven, becoming the Devil.
*Lucifer and [[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Chronos]] are the only Almighties not to have the "God" status in the religions they originate from.

